              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Several advanced glycation endproducts (AGEs) and α-dicarbonyls were measured by ultra performance liquid chromatography or high performance liquid chromatography in retinal detachment patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus and non-diabetic controls.  Patients were matched on age, estimated glomerular filtration rate, smoking, intra-ocular lens implantation, and proliferative vitreoretinopathy. Skin autofluorescence was measured by the AGE Reader."
                },
